[step] The female service-tab sockets' fore and aft clearance shoulders — the receiver keeps the carrier's complete 2.5 mm Y band while the tongue cavity is inset for one 0.45 mm printed side wall on each face. The nearby parallel planes are the outside of that wall and the functional socket opening, not accidental almost-flush surfaces.
